OL,3,GNEWSAPet loss stigma 'makes owners
OL,4,Adownplay their grief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Erin Hope Thompson, a clinical
OL,7,Fpsychologist, said: "Pet grief isn't
OL,8,Frecognised anywhere near as much as it
OL,9,Fshould be, and that's a sad reality. We
OL,10,Fneed to stop asking who died and start
OL,11,Fasking, 'How significant is this
OL,12,Floss?'"
